  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The graph shows how the electric potential <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span> varies with position <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> in a specific region of an electric field. The line passes through the points <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(0\\text{ cm}, 2\\text{ V})\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"(4\\text{ cm}, 20\\text{ V})\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude and direction of the electric field strength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> in the region between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x = 0\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x = 4\\text{ cm}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.5\\text{ V m}^{-1}\"></span> in the positive <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>-direction</p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"450\\text{ V m}^{-1}\"></span> in the negative <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>-direction</p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"450\\text{ V m}^{-1}\"></span> in the positive <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>-direction</p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0\\text{ V m}^{-1}\"></span> throughout the region</p></li></ol>"
  },
